---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="页面不存在" noindex>
  <div class="shell wrap">
    <div class="marker">404</div>
    <h1>这里没有东西</h1>
    <p>链接可能拼错了，或者那篇文章从来没有存在过。</p>
    <p class="acts">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">回到首页</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/blog/">看看博客</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .wrap { padding-block: 7rem 6rem; max-width: 620px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); margin-top: .5rem; }
  p { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 1rem; }
  .acts { display: flex; gap: .6rem; margin-top: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
